{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":2,"variant":0,"line_id":726590103,"next_line_ids":[726590104],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":3606061754,"text":"啊，你好！你就是那个...来自冒险家协会的钓鱼家吧？我是鲸井椛，稻妻本地的渔师。","raw_text":"啊，你好！你就是那个...来自冒险家协会的钓鱼家吧？我是鲸井椛，稻妻本地的渔师。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":3,"variant":0,"line_id":726590104,"next_line_ids":[726590105],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":3292327842,"text":"我从鱼协听说了你的事迹，今天一见，果然是年轻有为的样子，希望我没找错人。","raw_text":"我从鱼协听说了你的事迹，今天一见，果然是年轻有为的样子，希望我没找错人。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":4,"variant":0,"line_id":726590105,"next_line_ids":[726590106],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":1137365594,"text":"我最近正在寻找一条传说中的大鱼，叫作「海中月」，传说中，它能够实现人们的愿望。","raw_text":"我最近正在寻找一条传说中的大鱼，叫作「海中月」，传说中，它能够实现人们的愿望。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":726590106,"next_line_ids":[726590107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":3250142082,"text":"呜哇——实现愿望的大鱼欸！是我喜欢的传说故事！","raw_text":"呜哇——实现愿望的大鱼欸！是我喜欢的传说故事！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":726590107,"next_line_ids":[726590108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":1066108786,"text":"嗯，虽然大家都觉得是故事，但…我相信这是真的。","raw_text":"嗯，虽然大家都觉得是故事，但…我相信这是真的。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":7,"variant":0,"line_id":726590108,"next_line_ids":[726590109],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":4094277298,"text":"因为几年前，我可能真的遇到过「海中月」…","raw_text":"因为几年前，我可能真的遇到过「海中月」…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":726590109,"next_line_ids":[726590110],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":2036925346,"text":"那它实现了你的愿望吗?","raw_text":"那它实现了你的愿望吗?","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":726590110,"next_line_ids":[726590111],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":151815882,"text":"嗯…算是吧，事情是这样的。","raw_text":"嗯…算是吧，事情是这样的。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":10,"variant":0,"line_id":726590111,"next_line_ids":[726590112],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":939943466,"text":"几年前，因为各自的愿望，我和两个朋友，一个叫嘉玮，一个叫楠塔克，我们一起出海，去追捕这条传说中的「海中月」。","raw_text":"几年前，因为各自的愿望，我和两个朋友，一个叫嘉玮，一个叫楠塔克，我们一起出海，去追捕这条传说中的「海中月」。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":11,"variant":0,"line_id":726590112,"next_line_ids":[726590113],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":2919996298,"text":"但路途很不顺利，我们遭遇了雷暴，虽然渔船撑了下来，可罗盘彻底损坏了，我们迷失在一片未知的海域。","raw_text":"但路途很不顺利，我们遭遇了雷暴，虽然渔船撑了下来，可罗盘彻底损坏了，我们迷失在一片未知的海域。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":726590113,"next_line_ids":[726590114],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":2051733402,"text":"几天后，还是没有找到回家的方向，淡水已经告罄，大家虽然嘴上没说，但心里已经绝望了。","raw_text":"几天后，还是没有找到回家的方向，淡水已经告罄，大家虽然嘴上没说，但心里已经绝望了。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":13,"variant":0,"line_id":726590114,"next_line_ids":[726590115],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":4197775322,"text":"甚至有天半夜，嘉玮那家伙偷偷起来，写了遗书，放进漂流瓶丢了出去，接着想要投海。","raw_text":"甚至有天半夜，嘉玮那家伙偷偷起来，写了遗书，放进漂流瓶丢了出去，接着想要投海。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":14,"variant":0,"line_id":726590115,"next_line_ids":[726590116],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":77962154,"text":"他不知道，我们也没睡着，听见动静出去，这才拉住了他。也就在那时候，我们看见，海面下忽然浮现出了一个巨大的影子。","raw_text":"他不知道，我们也没睡着，听见动静出去，这才拉住了他。也就在那时候，我们看见，海面下忽然浮现出了一个巨大的影子。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":15,"variant":0,"line_id":726590116,"next_line_ids":[726590117],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":2179913722,"text":"那影子发着淡淡的荧光，星星点点地闪耀着，像打碎的月亮落入海洋。","raw_text":"那影子发着淡淡的荧光，星星点点地闪耀着，像打碎的月亮落入海洋。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":726590117,"next_line_ids":[726590118],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":2814810042,"text":"那是「海中月」吗？走投无路的我们这样想着，慌忙许愿，请它保佑我们平安返航。","raw_text":"那是「海中月」吗？走投无路的我们这样想着，慌忙许愿，请它保佑我们平安返航。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":726590118,"next_line_ids":[726590119],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":2296404746,"text":"是的，跟你想的一样，我们活下来了。那影子就像有魔力一样往远方游去，我们跟着它，那就是我们回家的路。","raw_text":"是的，跟你想的一样，我们活下来了。那影子就像有魔力一样往远方游去，我们跟着它，那就是我们回家的路。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":726590119,"next_line_ids":[726590120],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":1005,"speaker_text_hash":1356475093,"speaker":"派蒙","speaker_raw":"派蒙","text_hash":2650000946,"text":"呜哇——真是个令人感动的传说故事！","raw_text":"呜哇——真是个令人感动的传说故事！","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":19,"variant":0,"line_id":726590120,"next_line_ids":[726590121],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":2393175850,"text":"不，这是真的！相信我。我们一定还能再找到它。","raw_text":"不，这是真的！相信我。我们一定还能再找到它。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":20,"variant":0,"line_id":726590121,"next_line_ids":[726590122],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speaker_id":0,"speaker_text_hash":0,"speaker":"旅行者","speaker_raw":"旅行者","text_hash":3985000394,"text":"要怎么做？","raw_text":"要怎么做？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":21,"variant":0,"line_id":726590122,"next_line_ids":[726590123],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":828342250,"text":"先去找我那两位老朋友吧，他们都是经验丰富的渔师，有他们加入会轻松不少。","raw_text":"先去找我那两位老朋友吧，他们都是经验丰富的渔师，有他们加入会轻松不少。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72659","main_id":72659,"main_title":"月升之时","main_description":"稻妻渔师「鲸井椛」似乎有什么事想要找人帮忙…","chapter_title":"月升之时","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7265901,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7265901,"sequence":22,"variant":0,"line_id":726590123,"next_line_ids":[726590124],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3200,"speaker_text_hash":2404489101,"speaker":"鲸井椛","speaker_raw":"鲸井椛","text_hash":887707258,"text":"嘉玮就在璃月港，我知道他回了璃月港就没有出去过了，应该也很怀念「海中月」吧。","raw_text":"<color=#00E1FFFF>嘉玮就在璃月港，</color>我知道他回了璃月港就没有出去过了，应该也很怀念「海中月」吧。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7265901.json"}
